  "about": {
    "title": "About the Crimson Invasion set",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Pokémon TCG: Crimson Invasion is a Sun & Moon expansion released on 3 November 2017. It has 125 cards: 111 in the main set and 13 secret rares and 1 alternate versions. There are also 92 reverse holos.",
      "Choose what you’re collecting: the <b>Standard set</b> (the 111 main set cards), the <b>Master set</b> (203 cards, adding the reverse holos) or the <b>Grand Master set</b> (all 217 cards, adding the 13 secret rares and 1 alternate versions).",
      "This free checklist lets you tick off the cards you own, count spare copies for trading, see your progress by rarity and plan your binder pages. It works on phones and computers, even offline, and your collection stays on your device."
